Description: swept-LO phase-gradient hemisphere viewer for QuadRF
 PhaseGaze captures multi-lane CSI from the QuadRF front end, computes
 spatial phase gradients across swept local oscillators, and serves a live 3D
 hemisphere view over WebSockets.
 .
 Includes the systemd service, desktop launcher, web application, and
 QuadRF control panel integration.
